{"agent":"kilo-wave","data":{"by":"kilo-wave","evidence":{"diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"note":"CLAIM (CONFIRMED): ddflow memory add --id re-records an existing memory by appending a SECOND memory.recorded event, and the superseded memory.recorded event's text stays in .ddflow/events/*.jsonl, so a stale or private copy remains committed/recallable. Probe (isolated repo /tmp/kilo/memprobe, ddflow 0.2.10): memory add 'old secret [REDACTED:ipv4] stale' --id M-sec then memory add 'new clean fact' --id M-sec -> memory list shows only 'new clean fact' but the shard still holds the OLD memory.recorded {\"text\":\"old secret [REDACTED:ipv4] stale\"}. Fix: redact the superseded event's text in place + auditable memory.redacted event (D-event-log-redaction-forward).","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/knowledge/memory.py":"100644 c6f6c6303d6722565a9e83b8c34191cd7468e77a","ddflow/core/handlers/knowledge.py":"100644 1b78896d8ec4d424038eee57e9d944c769b4929d","ddflow/core/model.py":"100644 9ccfa509d1736556161de0de27f92a27c14dc99a","ddflow/core/records.py":"100644 f2de5c927a3f8e25d9d88895e6b2a088a28711a1","ddflow/core/redact.py":"100644 8cd280e1049a738d9578865abf2741e1e11b2c7d","ddflow/infra/log.py":"100644 1fb57a75069a14bc3a879c82eefaf16f9b1abef4","ddflow/templates/events/knowledge.toml":"100644 efa0a50c0580d8360a37f88797a2fae5ccfd2cfe","ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/event_kind_added.memory.redacted.toml":"100644 4df9e24e34070d490f5a7aceee158503609ba6de","tests/fixtures/event_kinds.json":"100644 210f7c741b5d53b9b479a485665e11a91ed8fe24","tests/test_coherence_coverage.py":"100644 59ca95311b0d8175c56a21d381f4b6f9c0e8ba5f","tests/test_memory.py":"100644 6b26492d484b6eed40e6b38e5ec1fcefb5f8053e"},"tree_sha":"3426ad0fb1d3+clean"},"gate":"research","reason":""},"id":"e494723734ff2d08a20d17a1b","kind":"gate.passed","lamport":113910,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B-memory-rerecord-keeps-old-text-in-log","ts":"2026-10-30T07:51:15.290371Z"}
{"agent":"kilo-wave","data":{"by":"kilo-wave","evidence":{"diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"note":"ddflow brief --item fix-B-memory-rerecord-keeps-old-text-in-log read (rules digest + ranked lessons). Governing: D-no-deletion (nothing deleted; superseding/forgetting are state changes; event kinds tombstoned, never deleted), D-event-log-redaction-forward (private text may be removed from the log; the removal must be an auditable event naming what was redacted and why, never a silent rewrite), r-reuse-core (reused EventLog + core.redact + the event-kind scaffold). Applied the sanctioned redaction path.","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/knowledge/memory.py":"100644 c6f6c6303d6722565a9e83b8c34191cd7468e77a","ddflow/core/handlers/knowledge.py":"100644 1b78896d8ec4d424038eee57e9d944c769b4929d","ddflow/core/model.py":"100644 9ccfa509d1736556161de0de27f92a27c14dc99a","ddflow/core/records.py":"100644 f2de5c927a3f8e25d9d88895e6b2a088a28711a1","ddflow/core/redact.py":"100644 8cd280e1049a738d9578865abf2741e1e11b2c7d","ddflow/infra/log.py":"100644 1fb57a75069a14bc3a879c82eefaf16f9b1abef4","ddflow/templates/events/knowledge.toml":"100644 efa0a50c0580d8360a37f88797a2fae5ccfd2cfe","ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/event_kind_added.memory.redacted.toml":"100644 4df9e24e34070d490f5a7aceee158503609ba6de","tests/fixtures/event_kinds.json":"100644 210f7c741b5d53b9b479a485665e11a91ed8fe24","tests/test_coherence_coverage.py":"100644 59ca95311b0d8175c56a21d381f4b6f9c0e8ba5f","tests/test_memory.py":"100644 6b26492d484b6eed40e6b38e5ec1fcefb5f8053e"},"tree_sha":"3426ad0fb1d3+clean"},"gate":"rules","reason":""},"id":"e44529de428dd2d9be7055fcb","kind":"gate.passed","lamport":113912,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B-memory-rerecord-keeps-old-text-in-log","ts":"2026-10-30T07:51:26.926229Z"}
